OL,3,GNEWSAShed offer enables community group
OL,4,Aworkshop dream
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe offer of a dilapidated shed has
OL,7,Fbeen welcomed with enthusiasm by a new
OL,8,Fcommunity group that aims to help men
OL,9,Ffeel less isolated.
OL,11,FWhile the former parish store in
OL,12,FTrewoon, Cornwall is derelict, the St
OL,13,FAustell Shed group see its potential as
OL,14,Fa dream home for the future.
OL,16,FSt Mewan Parish Council has confirmed
OL,17,Fit will invest a part of #20,000
OL,18,Fcommunity funds from a nearby wind
OL,19,Fturbine development to make the shed
OL,20,Fweatherproof and reconnect it to mains
OL,21,Fservices.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
