OL,3,GNEWSAShed offer enables community group
OL,4,Aworkshop dream
OL,5,
OL,6,FSt Austell Shed hope to raise thousands
OL,7,Fto turn the structure into a bespoke
OL,8,Fworkshop for community use, with
OL,9,Ftrustee, Ralph Abbott describing it as
OL,10,Fa "fantastic opportunity".
